{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ready?...Go!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HELLSPRINT is a first-person momentum-based speedrunner where you navigate tricky obstacles to reach the goal as fast as possible!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Quick Levels - Tricky Execution</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In HELLSPRINT, it's all about going for that<strong>\u00a0<i>perfect time </i></strong>(or at least a better time than your friends!). Most levels only take a couple of seconds to beat, which leaves more time to grind for an even better time!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Find YOUR Way - No Invisible Walls</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All levels have a<i>\u00a0normal</i>\u00a0way of getting to the finish line, but nothing is stopping you from finding your own, faster way.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3711160?t=1751023872","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711160/21602e72c1042db313af4b3f945b7569c68f9381/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1751023872","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711160/b48c781910e07df4f97ee372a638407e907495dd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751023872","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711160/b48c781910e07df4f97ee372a638407e907495dd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751023872","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3826680,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ready?...Go!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HELLSPRINT is a first-person momentum-based speedrunner where you navigate tricky obstacles to reach the goal as fast as possible!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Quick Levels - Tricky Execution</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In HELLSPRINT, it's all about going for that<strong>\u00a0<i>perfect time <